{"id":"en_my-bold-and-beautiful-wife","title":"My Bold and Beautiful Wife","titleEn":"My Bold and Beautiful Wife","description":"Su Su was taken in by the Su family as an adopted daughter, yet her birthday happens to fall on the same day as Su Ning, the family's biological daughter. Believing this coincidence could bring bad luck to Su Ning, the family subjects Su Su to mistreatment throughout her childhood and forces her to take medication. Eventually she kills the person in charge of the laboratory, and Lu Shiyan comes to her rescue. This marks the beginning of a relationship between them that is full of amusing moments.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-bold-and-beautiful-wife/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/my-bold-and-beautiful-wife/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Enemies to Lovers","The Comeback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d87um/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_my-bold-and-beautiful-wife_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d87um/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-bold-and-beautiful-wife_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d87um/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-bold-and-beautiful-wife_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d87um/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_my-bold-and-beautiful-wife_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d87um/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"e